    "detailed_description": "&quot;The Legend of Snow Maiden&quot; is a turn based role-playing game that integrates elements of ancient Chinese mythology. The player will transform into Akira, a loyal and brave female hero, embarking on a legendary adventure in search of the reincarnation of the Golden Boy and the help of the Snow Maiden. In this world full of challenges and adventures, players will face the conspiracy of the demon realm and delve deeper into the secrets hidden behind the five major families of Changbai Mountain.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/b7542453381a97c29554aa81acbf88e6.poster.avif?t=1714661808\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/b7542453381a97c29554aa81acbf88e6.webm?t=1714661808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/b7542453381a97c29554aa81acbf88e6.mp4?t=1714661808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the game world, players will encounter various distinctive monsters, from cunning foxes to alert weasels, from mysterious hedgehogs to intelligent mice, and then to fierce cockscomb snakes. Each type of monster has its unique abilities and guarded secrets. Players need to use wisdom and courage to win their support or unravel the knots in their hearts through negotiations or battles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/dbfa5cc5013d95745ab50ac4dfab4693.poster.avif?t=1714661808\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/dbfa5cc5013d95745ab50ac4dfab4693.webm?t=1714661808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/dbfa5cc5013d95745ab50ac4dfab4693.mp4?t=1714661808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game features rich storyline, in-depth character growth, carefully woven storyline and character background, allowing players to gradually uncover the story and motivation of each character while exploring. And introduced innovative combat systems\uff1a<br>(1)Combining the classic turn based model, introducing an innovative mechanism of five element state opposition, such as<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/3368523debf141b5fb990a89e243f3f4.webp?t=1714661808\" width=32 height=32 /></span>restrain<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/2adb060ac3412261295043ba79bc3bef.webp?t=1714661808\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\uff0c<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/8390f6034844bfde635c107139f6995d.webp?t=1714661808\" width=32 height=32 /></span>restrain<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/483b26080ffd071b1cfd15353ed36780.webp?t=1714661808\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\uff0c<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/56332fe457a6881bb4de8d23b29bcb01.webp?t=1714661808\" width=32 height=32 /></span>restrain<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/128e1e340a70ef6229f345d4ef0b3c03.webp?t=1714661808\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u7b49<br>(2)Weapon forging, item synthesis, and spirit beast system provide players with deep combat strategies. You can enhance the combat assistance effect of spirit beasts by giving them favorite items as gifts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/28ac98834489e4a57bc7acf5c2f42c68.poster.avif?t=1714661808\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/28ac98834489e4a57bc7acf5c2f42c68.webm?t=1714661808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939520/extras/28ac98834489e4a57bc7acf5c2f42c68.mp4?t=1714661808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;The Legend of Snow Maiden&quot; is a work tailored for players who love Chinese classical mythology and turn based role-playing games. The game not only provides rich combat and exploration experiences, but also allows players to feel the importance of morality and the profound influence of the story in every decision. Are you ready to embark on this journey of immortality and unveil the mysterious veil of Changbai Mountain?<br><br>&quot;The Legend of Snow Maiden&quot; - Searching for your destiny and true love in the chaotic world of immortal and demon conflicts. The chapter of adventure is about to unfold, please look forward to the surprises and challenges brought by this unknown journey. The game is not over, and the legend of Snow Girl continues. Players who like it should continue to look forward to this touching experience",
